69dd3753c8f4"],

Cell["\<\
a\\to \\frac{\\text{sgn} \\left(k_z \\cos (t)-\\sqrt{k_z^2 \\cos ^2(t)-4 \
k_y^4 \\tan ^2(t)}\\right)}{2 k_y^2 \\left(\\frac{1}{\\cos (t)}+1\\right)}\
\>", "Output",
